## Method note
Scores come from a deterministic engine: acceleration of overdose admissions, harm-versus-enforcement divergence, spillover from neighbouring cells and a Getis-Ord Gi* hotspot statistic, each measured against the cell's own Poisson noise, weighted {{ weights }} and mapped to 0–100. The Skeptic re-checks support, weight sensitivity (stability < 0.6 fails), data gaps, enforcement artefacts and single-source dependence. Every number in this brief comes from a logged tool call. This system predicts places, not people.
